{{!-- spec 025 — the evolve control of ONE equipment aspect (armor, fighting,
      marksmanship), rendered three times on the Overview tab.

      The handoff draws an unbounded ladder ("Nv N" + evolve + revert); the data
      model has exactly TWO states — the type's Starting Equipment and its
      Equipment Upgrades — so the ladder collapses to one step: evolve while at
      the starting set, revert while evolved. Never both at once, so the button
      always tells the truth about what it will do. --}}
{{#if evolved}}
<button type="button" class="csv2-btn csv2-btn--secondary csv2-btn--icon"
        data-action="setEvolved" data-aspect="{{aspect}}" data-evolved="false"
        data-tooltip="{{localize 'CS.sheets.unit.evolveRevert'}}">
    <i class="fas fa-minus"></i>
</button>
{{else}}
<button type="button" class="csv2-btn csv2-btn--sm csv2-btn--outline"
        data-action="setEvolved" data-aspect="{{aspect}}" data-evolved="true"
        data-tooltip="{{localize 'CS.sheets.unit.evolveHint'}}">
    <i class="fas fa-arrow-up"></i>{{localize "CS.sheets.unit.evolve"}}
</button>
{{/if}}
